{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b7e2a6b1-3f2a-4c9a-9a2e-4f2c9c1a7e10",
		"name": "Tenpo Backend Challenge",
		"description": "API REST en Spring Boot que suma dos números y aplica un porcentaje dinámico obtenido de un servicio externo (mockeado). Incluye reintentos, historial de invocaciones persistido de forma asíncrona, rate limiting (3 RPM) y manejo centralizado de errores.\n\nNo requiere autenticación.\n\nLevantar el proyecto (ver README):\n```\ndocker compose up --build\n```\nLa API queda disponible en http://localhost:8080 (Swagger UI en /swagger-ui.html).\n\nVariable `baseUrl` ya apunta a http://localhost:8080 — cambiala en el entorno/colección si corriste la API en otro host/puerto.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "0"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Calculation",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "POST /calculate - happy path",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"num1\": 5,\n  \"num2\": 5\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"calculate"
							]
						},
						"description": "Suma num1 + num2 y aplica el porcentaje del servicio externo mockeado (fijo en 10%).\n\nRespuesta esperada:\n```json\n{\"num1\": 5, \"num2\": 5, \"percentage\": 10, \"result\": 11.00}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "POST /calculate - decimal numbers",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"num1\": 12.5,\n  \"num2\": 7.25\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"calculate"
							]
						},
						"description": "Verifica que el cálculo funciona correctamente con BigDecimal (evita errores de redondeo binario). result se redondea a 2 decimales (HALF_UP)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "POST /calculate - missing field (400)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"num1\": 5\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"calculate"
							]
						},
						"description": "Falta num2 -> 400 Bad Request con el ErrorResponse centralizado.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T04:06:40.643Z\",\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"message\": \"num2: num2 is required\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/calculate\"\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "POST /calculate - malformed JSON (400)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{ \"num1\": 5, \"num2\": }"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"calculate"
							]
						},
						"description": "Body JSON malformado -> 400 Bad Request."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "POST /calculate - wrong type for num1 (400)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"num1\": \"abc\",\n  \"num2\": 5\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"calculate"
							]
						},
						"description": "num1 con tipo incorrecto (string en vez de número) -> 400 Bad Request."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoint que suma dos números y les aplica el porcentaje dinámico del servicio externo (mockeado, con reintentos vía Resilience4j)."
		},
